<!DOCTYPE html><!-- Last Published: Wed Oct 07 2026 20:56:40 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time) --><html data-wf-domain="www.rothera.io" data-wf-page="6aa82639fc3b0ae00f80c03d" data-wf-site="6a99b37483d294062ea71053" lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><link href="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com" rel="preconnect" crossorigin="anonymous"/><title>Company</title><meta content="Rothera is a derivatives exchange and clearinghouse regulated by the U.S. Commodity Futures Trading Commission (CFTC)." name="description"/><meta content="Company" property="og:title"/><meta content="Rothera is a derivatives exchange and clearinghouse regulated by the U.S. Commodity Futures Trading Commission (CFTC)." property="og:description"/><meta content="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6978d5a16c310602186d0bfe/697a6c315b8e98fd096d0ea8_Rothera_Base_Logo_OpenGraph.png" property="og:image"/><meta content="Company" name="twitter:title"/><meta content="Rothera is a derivatives exchange and clearinghouse regulated by the U.S. Commodity Futures Trading Commission (CFTC)." name="twitter:description"/><meta content="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6978d5a16c310602186d0bfe/697a6c315b8e98fd096d0ea8_Rothera_Base_Logo_OpenGraph.png" name="twitter:image"/><meta property="og:type" content="website"/><meta content="summary_large_image" name="twitter:card"/><meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" name="viewport"/><link href="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a99b37483d294062ea71053/css/ledgerx-5e80c6e7301127f96-7bd99375728f3.shared.8949fd0b4.css" rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" integrity="sha384-iUn9C0lNWmAmSCla5GDqYMQXb7eq1lI7WGHBuhwsulkzErhk4/FkBiOCTDTFmtRB" crossorigin="anonymous"/><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" rel="preconnect"/><link href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" rel="preconnect" crossorigin="anonymous"/><script src="https://ajax.googleapis.com/ajax/libs/webfont/1.6.26/webfont.js" type="text/javascript"></script><script type="text/javascript">WebFont.load({  g