<meta name="analytics.txt" content="GooGhywoiu9839t543j0s7543uw1 - pls add analytics@rothera.io to GA account 48984837 with ‘Administrator‘ permissions - date 06/01/2026." /></head><body class="body-4"><div class="company-hero-new company-header-new"><div data-collapse="medium" data-animation="default" data-duration="400" data-easing="ease" data-easing2="ease" role="banner" class="navigation w-nav"><div class="navigation-wrap"><a href="/" class="logo-link w-nav-brand"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a99b37483d294062ea71053/6a99b37483d294062ea71188_Website%20Full%20Logo.png" loading="lazy" width="200" height="Auto" alt="" class="image-17"/></a><div class="menu"><nav role="navigation" class="navigation-items w-nav-menu"><a href="/venue" class="navigation-item outline-button w-nav-link">Venue</a><div data-hover="true" data-delay="0" class="dropdown w-dropdown"><div class="dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="icon w-icon-dropdown-toggle"></div><div class="navigation-item">Solutions</div></div><nav class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><a href="/solutions" class="nav-link-drop-down mobile-subnav w-dropdown-link">FCMs</a><a href="/solutions" class="nav-link-drop-down mobile-subnav w-dropdown-link">Market Makers</a></nav></div><a href="/company" aria-current="page" class="navigation-item outline-button w-nav-link w--current">Company</a><a href="/faq" class="navigation-item outline-button w-nav-link">FAQ</a><a href="/careers" class="navigation-item outline-button w-nav-link">Careers</a><a href="/news-and-insights" class="navigation-item outline-button w-nav-link">News &amp; Insights</a><a href="/contact" class="navigation-item outline-button w-nav-link">Contact</a></nav><div class="menu-button w-nav-button"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a99b37483d294062ea71053/6a99b37483d294062ea71069_menu_icon2.svg" width="22" alt="" class="menu-icon"/></div></div></div></div><div class="my-container header-height"><div class="div-block-89"><div class="page-title">Institutional Infrastructure<br/>for Event Contracts<br/></div><div class="text-block-27">Rothera’s mission is to operate the premier CFTC-regulated event contract market providing trading and clearing services to FCMs and market makers.</div></div></div></div><div class="event-contracts-script"><div class="faq-section-title"><div class="div-block-15"></div><h4 class="heading-11">Our Ethos</h4></div><div class="paragraph intro">An Ethos of Responsibility<br/></div><p class="paragraph-8">We believe the standards set today will form the foundation for the future of event contract markets.</p><div class="content-section"><div id="w-node-_6b1efdad-2700-61bb-ded6-2fbf459f9f51-0f80c03d" class="why-us-section-wrapper"><div class="w-layout-grid grid-6"><div id="w-node-_6b1efdad-2700-61bb-ded6-2fbf459f9f53-0f80c03d" class="ethos-card"><h1 class="ethos-heading">Maintain Market Integrity</h1><p class="paragraph-9">Promote ecosystem quality through strong protections against fraud and manipulation.</p></div><div class="ethos-card"><h1 class="ethos-heading">Put Compliance First</h1><p class="paragraph-10">List only event contracts that comply with the Commodity Exchange Act (CEA) and Core Principles.</p></div><div class="ethos-card"><h1 class="ethos-heading">Preserve Reputation</h1><p class="paragraph-11">Evaluate listings with an eye toward market integrity and the reputations of Rothera and the firms on our venue.</p></div><div class="ethos-card"><h1 class="ethos-heading">Focus on Longevity</h1><p class="paragraph-12">Operate under U.S. legal and federal regulatory jurisdiction, backed by leading capital markets firms committed to the long-term development of the market.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="faq-section-title"><div class="div-block-15"></div><h4 class="heading-11">Our Approach</h4></div><div class="paragraph intro">Why Rothera?<br/></div><p class="paragraph-8">Our approach is designed to meet the expectations of established financial institutions.</p><div class="why-rothera-containers"><div id="w-node-_2dc6c2e1-fbcb-d1d1-c93e-9a04138793da-0f80c03d" class="why-us-section-wrapper"><div class="w-layout-grid grid-6"><div id="w-node-_2dc6c2e1-fbcb-d1d1-c93e-9a04138793dc-0f80c03d" class="ethos-card"><h1 class="ethos-heading">Alignment</h1><p class="paragraph-9">We don’t compete with FCMs for end-customer relationships or operate an in-house market maker, minimizing channel and trading conflicts.</p></div><div class="ethos-card"><h1 class="ethos-heading">Collaboration</h1><p class="paragraph-10">We develop products and services alongside FCMs and market makers, within a market structure designed to support ecosystem-wide quality.</p></div><div class="ethos-card"><h1 class="ethos-heading">Discipline</h1><p class="paragraph-11">We take a selective approach to listings, applying sound and well-informed financial markets judgment to a rapidly evolving category.</p></div><div class="ethos-card"><h1 class="ethos-heading">Experience &amp; Innovation</h1><p class="paragraph-12">Our team brings extensive experience designing listed products and electronic trading solutions at exchanges, clearinghouses, prime brokers, and beyond.</p></div><div class="ethos-card"><h1 class="ethos-heading">Reputation &amp; Relationships</h1><p class="paragraph-12">Decades of work across regulated capital markets have built longstanding relationships with ISVs, infrastructure providers and buy-side and sell-side firms.</p></div></div><a href="/faq" class="button-3 w-button">Explore FAQs</a></div></div><div class="faq-section-title"><div class="div-block-15"></div><h4 class="heading-11">Meet the Team</h4></div><div class="paragraph intro">Led by Market Practitioners<br/></div><p class="paragraph-8">Our leadership team brings decades of experience building and operating regulated financial markets.</p><div class="content-section"><div id="w-node-_0e243b4b-7820-627c-7c5e-a8a7b4cc5419-0f80c03d" class="why-us-section-wrapper"><div class="w-layout-grid grid-6"><div id="w-node-_0e243b4b-7820-627c-7c5e-a8a7b4cc541b-0f80c03d" class="ethos-card-dark"><h1 class="ethos-heading">Thomas Chippas</h1><h1 class="heading-14">CEO and Co-Founder</h1><p class="paragraph-9-copy light">Thomas Chippas brings more than 30 years of experience spanning digital assets, technology and financial services. He was most recently CEO and Director of Argo Blockchain. Prior to that, Mr. Chippas built and scaled Cboe Digital (formerly known as ErisX), a DCM/DCO and spot market for digital assets, as CEO, spearheading its sale to Cboe in 2022. Before that, he was a COO of Axoni, Chief Executive Officer of Citadel Technology, and held senior leadership roles at Citi, Barclays and Deutsche Bank.</p><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer w-container"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/chippas/" target="_blank" class="link-block-4 w-inline-block"></a></div></div><div id="w-node-_26fb9e7a-e8b8-25b5-ae38-bde4baf20aea-0f80c03d" class="ethos-card-dark"><h1 class="ethos-heading">Matt Trudeau</h1><h1 class="heading-14">President and Co-Founder</h1><p class="paragraph-9-copy light">Matt Trudeau was previously Chief Executive Officer at Nori, leading the development of a carbon removal credit market and registry. Prior to that, he was COO at Cboe Digital (formerly known as ErisX). A serial exchange founder, Matt has more than 25 years of experience in electronic trading and financial markets and has led or assisted in launching and operating 14 markets for equities, commodities, derivatives, and cryptocurrencies in the U.S., Europe and Asia in leadership roles at IEX, Instinet, and Chi-X.</p><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer w-container"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/matthewtrudeau/" target="_blank" class="link-block-4 w-inline-block"></a></div></div><div id="w-node-_20df519a-3a56-e378-e1d3-c11c60b9e002-0f80c03d" class="ethos-card-dark"><h1 class="ethos-heading">Bryan Stuart</h1><h1 class="heading-14">Chief Financial Officer</h1><p class="paragraph-9-copy light">Bryan Stuart brings more than 30 years of finance experience, having held CFO roles at Cboe Digital (formerly known as ErisX), Abundant Venture Partners, Livevol, Junction Solutions and more. He began his career at Deloitte where he served clients in the financial services industry, including securities and futures exchanges/clearing organizations, brokers/dealers, FCMs, private investment funds, and registered investment advisors.</p><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer w-container"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/bryan-s-2b3b484/" target="_blank" class="link-block-4 w-inline-block"></a></div></div><div id="w-node-_3f6f7435-77f6-4ca8-453f-de8aa7526b57-0f80c03d" class="ethos-card-dark"><h1 class="ethos-heading">Joseph McGlawn, CFA</h1><h1 class="heading-14">Chief Clearing Officer</h1><p class="paragraph-9-copy light">Joseph McGlawn was most recently Head of Cboe Clear U.S., and before that was Head of Clearing at ErisX, where he spent five years overseeing the clearing and settlement of the firm’s crypto spot and futures markets. Including his time at Barclays prior to ErisX, he brings nearly two decades of clearing experience.</p><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-6 w-container"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jmcglawn/" target="_blank" class="link-block-4 w-inline-block"></a></div></div><div id="w-node-b4f7aae0-96a5-a508-a378-e68541f3c1e7-0f80c03d" class="ethos-card-dark"><h1 class="ethos-heading">Ian Grieves</h1><h1 class="heading-14">Chief Product Officer</h1><p class="paragraph-9-copy light">Ian Grieves brings more than 25 years in financial services roles spanning trading, brokerage and technology. He was most recently VP Product and Strategy at Cboe Digital (formerly known as ErisX), where he spent more than seven years leading product. Prior to that, he was a Director of Product Management at Vela Trading Technologies (formerly Object Trading).</p><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-7 w-container"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/igrieves/" target="_blank" class="link-block-4 w-inline-block"></a></div></div><div id="w-node-_0e243b4b-7820-627c-7c5e-a8a7b4cc5420-0f80c03d" class="ethos-card ethos-card-dark"><h1 class="ethos-heading">Laurian Cristea</h1><h1 class="heading-14">General Counsel</h1><p class="paragraph-10 paragraph-9-copy">Laurian Cristea brings more than 15 years of experience at the intersection of traditional finance, digital assets, and now event contract markets. He joins Rothera from Barnes &amp; Thornburg LLP, where he was a partner and led the firm’s financial innovation practice. Previously, Mr. Cristea served as General Counsel at Cboe Digital (formerly known as ErisX), where he was a key architect of the firm’s regulatory strategy leading up to its acquisition by Cboe. His career also includes significant experience at an international clearinghouse group based in London, and at the CFTC in the Division of Market Oversight.</p><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-8 w-container"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/lbcristea/" target="_blank" class="link-block-4 w-inline-block"></a></div></div></div></div></div><div class="paragraph intro">Launch Timeline<br/></div><section class="launch-timeline"><div class="launch-timeline-container"><div class="hero-wrapper-4-copy"><div class="hero-split-3-copy"><div class="faq-section-title"><div class="div-block-15"></div><h4 class="heading-11">JULY 2025</h4></div><div class="paragraph-copy intro">Rothera Founded<br/></div><p class="paragraph-8-copy-copy">Founding team and vision established</p></div></div></div><div class="launch-timeline-container"><div class="hero-wrapper-4-copy"><div class="hero-split-3-copy"><div class="faq-section-title"><div class="div-block-15"></div><h4 class="heading-11">OCTOBER 2025</h4></div><div class="paragraph-copy intro">Joint Venture Funding Secured<br/></div><p class="paragraph-8-copy-copy">Strategic investment from Robinhood and Susquehanna International Group</p></div></div></div><div class="launch-timeline-container"><div class="hero-wrapper-4-copy"><div class="hero-split-3-copy"><div class="faq-section-title"><div class="div-block-15"></div><h4 class="heading-11">NOVEMBER 2025</h4></div><div class="paragraph-copy intro">MIAXdx Acquisition Announced<br/></div><p class="paragraph-8-copy-copy">Announced agreement to acquire MIAXdx, a CFTC regulated DCM, DCO, and SEF</p></div></div></div><div class="launch-timeline-container"><div class="hero-wrapper-4-copy"><div class="hero-split-3-copy"><div class="faq-section-title"><div class="div-block-15"></div><h4 class="heading-11">JANUARY 2026</h4></div><div class="paragraph-copy intro">MIAXdx Acquisition Closed<br/></div><p class="paragraph-8-copy-copy">Completed regulatory approvals and finalized the acquisition of MIAXdx</p></div></div></div><div class="launch-timeline-container"><div class="hero-wrapper-4-copy"><div class="hero-split-3-copy"><div class="faq-section-title"><div class="div-block-15"></div><h4 class="heading-11">MAY 2026</h4></div><div class="paragraph-copy intro">Initial Launch<br/></div><p class="paragraph-8-copy-copy">Core PCE Price Index, U.S. Weekly Jobless, Professional Baseball</p></div></div></div><div class="launch-timeline-container"><div class="hero-wrapper-4-copy"><div class="hero-split-3-copy"><div class="faq-section-title"><div class="div-block-15"></div><h4 class="heading-11">JUNE 2026</h4></div><div class="paragraph-copy intro">Expanded Listings<br/></div><p class="paragraph-8-copy-copy">Soccer, Tennis, Fed Rate Announcement</p></div></div></div><div class="launch-timeline-container"><div class="hero-wrapper-4-copy"><div class="hero-split-3-copy"><div class="faq-section-title"><div class="div-block-15"></div><h4 class="heading-11">JULY 2026 Onward</h4></div><div class="paragraph-copy intro">Continued Expansion<br/></div><p class="paragraph-8-copy-copy">Professional Football, College Football, Elections, Professional Golf, Professional Hockey, Professional Basketball (with more to follow in Q3/Q4)</p></div></div></div></section><div class="paragraph intro">Regulation<br/></div><p class="paragraph-8">Rothera operates a derivatives exchange and clearinghouse regulated by the U.S. Commodity Futures Trading Commission (CFTC), with the following registrations:</p><div class="regulation-section"><div id="w-node-_227e2ea3-897a-6ac9-1ae4-2361ae8faeca-0f80c03d" class="regulation-section-wrapper"><div class="w-layout-grid grid-6-copy"><div id="w-node-_227e2ea3-897a-6ac9-1ae4-2361ae8faecc-0f80c03d" class="ethos-card"><h1 class="ethos-heading">Designated Contract Market (DCM)</h1></div><div class="ethos-card"><h1 class="ethos-heading">Derivatives Clearing Organization (DCO)</h1></div><div class="ethos-card"><h1 class="ethos-heading">Swap Execution Facility (SEF –  Dormant)</h1></div></div><a href="/regulatory-notices" class="button-3 w-button">Learn More</a></div></div></div><div class="universal-footer-cta-copy universal-footer-header-copy"><div class="my-container-copy header-height"><div class="div-block-88"><div class="page-title-copy">Take the Next Step<br/></div><div class="text-block-27-copy text-block-27">Connect with our team to learn more about how Rothera can support your participation in the event contracts market.</div><a href="/contact" class="button-2 w-button">Contact Us</a></div></div></div><footer class="footer section-5"><div class="footer-content"><div class="footer-text">© 2026 Rothera. All Rights Reserved.</div><a href="/regulatory-notices" class="footer-text">Regulatory Notices</a><a href="/drafts/legal" class="footer-text">Legal</a><a href="/drafts/careers" class="footer-text">Careers</a></div><div class="footer-social-media"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/rothera/" target="_blank" class="link-block social w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a99b37483d294062ea71053/6a99b37483d294062ea7106c_icon_linkedin%402x.svg" alt="" class="footer-icon"/></a><a href="https://twitter.com/ledgerx" target="_blank" class="link-block-2 social w-inline-block"></a><a href="https://t.me/LedgerXTrading" target="_blank" class="link-block-2 social w-inline-block"></a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC7LCIP_wQmibwmWPlQFi1bQ/featured" target="_blank" class="link-block-2 social w-inline-block"></a></div></footer><script src="https://d3e54v103j8qbb.cloudfront.net/js/jquery-3.5.1.min.dc5e7f18c8.js?site=6a99b37483d294062ea71053" type="text/javascript" integrity="sha256-9/aliU8dGd2tb6OSsuzixeV4y/faTqgFtohetphbbj0=" crossorigin="anonymous"></script><script src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a99b37483d294062ea71053/js/ledgerx-5e80c6e7301127f96-7bd99375728f3.schunk.36b8fb49256177c8.js" type="text/javascript" integrity="sha384-4abIlA5/v7XaW1HMXKBgnUuhnjBYJ/Z9C1OSg4OhmVw9O3QeHJ/qJqFBERCDPv7G" crossorigin="anonymous"></script><script src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a99b37483d294062ea71053/js/ledgerx-5e80c6e7301127f96-7bd99375728f3.b4ca6114.1feb1cc3e8100d5e.js" type="text/javascript" integrity="sha384-siHRaPyKXB2Rg5djk+lWbGi5JQn8SDp4U1Db0xLNXb+cm+UABY8OfwDQa90/8LI7" crossorigin="anonymous"></script></body></html>